&lt;p&gt;Bold is looking for a talented UI Developer with a strong CSS and HTML skillset. &lt;br&gt; This person will take designs from our Awesome Designer and convert them into well architected CSS and HTML for use in our web and mobile applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are based in San Francisco, with the bulk of our engineering and operations teams in Phoenix. . We all share a deep commitment in realizing the possibilities that crypto protocols represent in changing finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical web skills in: CSS, HTML, Javascript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with a Javascript framework &lt;strong&gt;optional&lt;/strong&gt; but a +1 (we use AngularJS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integration of front­end frameworks like AngularJS with Restful JSON backend APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use of Git for code source control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player, you may be assisting and collaborating with other developers/designers outside your primary job responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self confidence to know, when to ask questions and when to speak up with alternate solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal accountability, to self delegate tasks and meet goals w/ and w/o direct guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the cryptocurrency ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of SASS or LESS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Angular JS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Phonegap, Titanium or other app packing system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong open source community presence/participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
